<title>LITHUANIA: ROKISHKIS APRIL SALES FALL SLIGHTLY.</title>
<headline>ROKISHKIS APRIL SALES FALL SLIGHTLY.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official list company Rokishkis Cheese said on Wednesday that its sales dipped to 9.89 million litas in April compared to 10.4 million litas a month earlier.</p>
<p>Company financial specialist Nijole Zabieliene told Reuters that the sales in April 1996 were 4.57 million litas.</p>
<p>The company has a share capital of 30.24 million litas and its audited net profit in 1996 was 10.46 million litas.</p>
<p>The company's sales in 1996 were 123.46 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
